{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573", "id": 1029974891, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s49ZCtr", "number": 1573, "title": "How to build a Mock-Drone?", "user": {"login": "twissmueller", "id": 862467, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjQ2Nw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862467?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller", "html_url": "https://github.com/twissmueller", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2021-10-19T07:50:42Z", "updated_at": "2023-06-01T07:28:38Z", "closed_at": "2023-06-01T07:28:38Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I have QGroundControl and want to create a waypoint mission that a \"virtual drone\" or a software-mock of a drone will fly. The code for the drone shall run on iOS, therefore I am using Swift.\r\n\r\nWhile I understand what code to write to command a drone (arm, takeoff, land, ...) I am having trouble figuring out how to use MAVSDK to receive those commands and reply with a \"faked\" response.\r\n\r\nFor my understanding, the mock-drone would need to send out a heartbeat messages and also telemetry messages.\r\n\r\nHow would I send a heartbeat/telemetry message with MAVSDK to QGroundControl?\r\n\r\nAny hints highly appreciated.", "closed_by": {"login": "ykhedar", "id": 8597831, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTc4MzE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8597831?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar", "html_url": "https://github.com/ykhedar", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ykhedar/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/946511155", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573#issuecomment-946511155", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573", "id": 946511155, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s44ap0z", "user": {"login": "bazfp", "id": 1307881, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDc4ODE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1307881?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp", "html_url": "https://github.com/bazfp", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-10-19T09:05:20Z", "updated_at": "2021-10-19T09:05:20Z", "body": "You have two approaches on this.\r\n\r\nYou can use an Autopilot simulator (Ardupilot SITL or px4 gazebo simulator)\r\n\r\nOr\r\n\r\nUse the MAVSDK \"server\" plugins here: https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/autopilot_server/autopilot_server.cpp\r\n\r\nThe server plugins will give you the ability to provide mock vehicle data.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/946511155/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/946647562", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573#issuecomment-946647562", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1573", "id": 946647562, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s44bLIK", "user": {"login": "twissmueller", "id": 862467, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjQ2Nw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862467?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller", "html_url": "https://github.com/twissmueller", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/twissmueller/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-10-19T11:55:42Z", "updated_at": "2021-10-19T11:55:42Z", "body": "> You can use an Autopilot simulator (Ardupilot SITL or px4 gazebo simulator)\r\n\r\nThe \"drone\" is going to be an iOS app. I guess, that excludes this option.\r\n\r\n> Use the MAVSDK \"server\" plugins here: https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/autopilot_server/autopilot_server.cpp\r\n> \r\